#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pos_tare.field_product_template__tare_weight
msgid ""
"Set here Constant tare weight for the given product. This tare will be "
"subtracted when the product is weighed."
msgstr ""
"Introduïr açí el pes constant de tara per a aquest producte. La tara es "
"restarà quan el producte siga pesat."

